Spoilers:

Sickness: most of the time, drinking this will make you sick. But if your
          reality is already altered, it might bring you back to your
          senses.

Confusion: It's good to be confused sometimes, some scrolls have different
           effects.

Paralsys: Well, you wouldn't want to drink this. But there's other things
          to do with a potion besides drinking.

Total spoilers:

Sickness: Drink when hallucinating. You'll stop.

Confusion: Drink it, then read scroll of enchant weapon/armor to rustproof
           your equipment.

Paralysis: Throw it at monsters to paralyze them. Special bonus spoiler:
           If you paralyze the Wizard of Yendor and then run up the stairs
           before the potion wears off, he won't be able to reappear again
           in the game.


